                <pb facs="0117" n="105" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg105"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.00/1–1645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacVeagh</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-16">January 16,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>48. ReDeptel 43, January 15. Plastiras telegram to President and latter’s reply
                    released to press on January 16. Please inform Greek Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
